{"id":"interstellarstay","lines":[{"t":0.533,"end":1.753,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Stay..","de":"Bleib...","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":37.084,"end":38.384,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Tell him, Murph.","de":"Sag es ihm, Murph.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":38.947,"end":40.167,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Make him stay.","de":"Bring ihn dazu zu bleiben.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":44.034,"end":45.254,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Make him stay, Murph.","de":"Bring ihn dazu zu bleiben, Murph.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":54.25,"end":55.67,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Make him stay, Murph!","de":"Bring ihn dazu zu bleiben, Murph!","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":57.784,"end":59.294,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Don't let me leave, Murph!","de":"Lass mich nicht gehen, Murph!","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":63.077,"end":65.497,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Do- Don't let me leave, Murph!","de":"La- Lass mich nicht gehen, Murph!","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":70.292,"end":73.992,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"No, no, no! Nooooo!","de":"Nein, nein, nein! Neeein!","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":94.051,"end":95.271,"chars":[1],"who":"Murph","text":"It was you..","de":"Du warst es...","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":107.484,"end":108.704,"chars":[1],"who":"Murph","text":"You were my ghost..","de":"Du warst mein Geist...","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":118.459,"end":122.679,"chars":[2],"who":"TARS","text":"Cooper, Cooper? Come in Cooper.","de":"Cooper, Cooper? Bitte kommen, Cooper.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":123.734,"end":124.954,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"TARS?","de":"TARS?","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":125.092,"end":126.312,"chars":[2],"who":"TARS","text":"Rodger that.","de":"Verstanden.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":128.087,"end":129.307,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"You survived.","de":"Du hast's geschafft.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":129.384,"end":135.264,"chars":[2],"who":"TARS","text":"Somewhere.. in their fifth dimension. They saved us.","de":"Irgendwo... in ihrer fünften Dimension. Sie haben uns gerettet.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":135.743,"end":141.073,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Yeah.. Who the hell is they and just why would they wanna help us, huh?","de":"Ja... Wer zum Teufel ist 'sie', und warum zum Teufel wollen die uns helfen, hä?","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":140.951,"end":147.601,"chars":[2],"who":"TARS","text":"I don't know but they constructed this three dimensional space inside their five dimensional reality to allow you understand it.","de":"Weiß ich nicht, aber sie haben diesen dreidimensionalen Raum in ihrer fünfdimensionalen Realität gebaut.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":147.6,"end":148.82,"chars":[0],"who":"Cooper","text":"Yeah that ain't working.","de":"Ja, das bringt nichts.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":149.708,"end":150.928,"chars":[2],"who":"TARS","text":"Yes it is.","de":"Doch, das tut es.","orig":"scenes/interstellarstay/lines/19.mp3"}]}